# Trellis API-reference docs: shipped identically by the template inside with-trellis runs,
# and regenerated by the Trellis doc-sync (on `dotnet build` or when opening the project in
# Visual Studio) into the nearest .github/ — often the benchmark repo root. Either way they
# are bulky, reproducible, and not part of the benchmark, so never commit them anywhere.
**/.github/trellis-api-*.md
**/.github/trellis-value-object-taxonomy.md
/.github/trellis-api-*.md
/.github/trellis-value-object-taxonomy.md

